    <comment>Ten-second high-contrast supernatural flicker for the two Despacho RGB DMX fixtures. Dense irregular 50-300 ms red/crimson/violet pulses, deliberately offset between fixtures. Only 03-Desp01 and 04-Desp02 are used; the final 300 ms are black.</comment>
